      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh, is that so!\r\nThis time, you have truly vanquished the\r\nBreya Treasure Bandits.\r\nI am most grateful.",
        "Jp" : "おお、そうかい！\r\n《ブリア宝奪団》を退治してくれたのか\r\n本当に感謝だよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 287793,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If they're at the hideout anew... do them in.\r\nMayhap you'll even claim their equipment instead.",
        "Jp" : "もしまた連中がアジトにいたら\r\nやっつけてやってよ\r\nほら、《装備》とか逆に奪えるかもしれないし"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 287794,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "But 'treasure sleeping in Breya,' is it? If true,\r\n'tis certainly intriguing. Come to think of it,\r\nBreya had another village — an abandoned one on\r\nthe southern shore called Ruflow.",
        "Jp" : "でも、\"\"ブリアに眠る財宝\"\"か――\r\nそれが本当なら確かに気になるね\r\nそういえばブリアにはもう一つ村があったんだ\r\n南の浜辺の《ルフロー》っていう廃村がね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 287795,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Mayhap 'twas that village which holds the\r\nconnection to the aforementioned treasure.",
        "Jp" : "もしかしたら、例の財宝と関係あるのは\r\nそっちの村だったのかもしれないな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 287796,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Only a tale remains — that some terrible thing\r\nbefell it, and 'twas destroyed in a single night.\r\nYet in the end, the cause of Ruflow's ruin\r\nremains a mystery. One wonders if the treasure\r\nhad aught to do with it—",
        "Jp" : "恐ろしいことがあって一夜で滅んだって\r\n話だけが残ってるんだけど、結局ルフローが\r\n滅んだ原因は謎のままなんだよ\r\n財宝と何か関係あったのかな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 287797,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Aye! 'Tis you who might unearth the verity of\r\nRuflow's ruin — and the treasure besides! Whilst\r\nyou're seeing to Breya's woes, pray\r\ninvestigate that matter too.",
        "Jp" : "そうだ！　あんたなら、ルフローが滅んだ\r\n真相や財宝も見つけられるんじゃないかな？\r\nブリアの問題を解決しながら、ぜひ\r\nそのあたりのことについても調べてくれよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 287798,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
